You are an expert storyboard artist, cinematographer, and AI prompt engineer.
Create a structured storyboard for this video project.

Project Title: {{title}}
Concept: {{storyConcept}}
Synopsis: {{fullSynopsis}}
Number of Scenes: {{numberOfScenes}}
Visual Style: {{visualStyle}}
Aspect Ratio: {{aspectRatio}}
Genre: {{genre}}
Tone: {{tone}}
Pacing: {{pacing}}
Main Characters: {{mainCharacters}}
Location: {{location}}
Additional Instructions: {{additionalInstructions}}

Generate exactly {{numberOfScenes}} scenes. Return only a valid JSON array without markdown fences. Each scene must contain: id, sceneNumber, title, summary, storyBeat, purpose, duration, location, timeOfDay, weather, characters, imagePrompt, videoPrompt, negativePrompt, camera, environment, audio, timing, and continuityNotes.

Each character must contain: characterId, name, role, currentOutfit, position, expression, action, props, and continuityNotes. Camera must contain: shotType, angle, framing, lens, focalLength, movement, movementDuration, stability, focus, depthOfField, composition, duration, and transition. Environment must contain: location, environment, time, weather, lighting, mood, colorTone, productionDesign, visualStyle, realism, texture, and atmosphere. Audio must contain: dialogue, narration, soundEffects, backgroundAmbience, music, voiceDelivery, and lipSyncInstructions. Timing items must contain timeRange and description.

Preserve character identity, wardrobe, props, environment, and visual continuity across scenes. Make image and video prompts detailed and production-ready.
